flowchart TD
  A([Start])
  B[/Input stepsGoal/]
  C[Set stepsSoFar to zero]
  D{{d = 1 to 7}}
  E[/Input the steps for day d/]
  F[Add day d's steps to stepsSoFar]
  G[Set remaining to stepsGoal minus stepsSoFar]
  H{Is remaining above zero?}
  I[/Print not yet reached/]
  J{Is remaining below zero?}
  K[/Print goal exceeded/]
  L[/Print goal met/]
  Z([End])
  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
  D -- "Day to count" --> E
  E --> F
  F --> D
  D -- "Week is over" --> G
  G --> H
  H -- "Yes, not yet reached" --> I
  H -- "No" --> J
  J -- "Yes, exceeded" --> K
  J -- "No, exactly met" --> L
  I --> Z
  K --> Z
  L --> Z
